<title>CHINA: Kwong Hing declares 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Kwong Hing declares 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 37.6</p>
<p>Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	11.61 gain</p>
<p>    Net			  44.25</p>
<p>    Turnover		   381.80</p>
<p>    Company name	     Kwong Hing International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		August 8-14</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Knitted fabrics maker Kwong Hing was listed on the Stock Exchange on March 19.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposals of investment properties and leasehold properties together with furniture and fixtures which arose as part of the group's reorganisation.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
